Vendored W3C ACT-Rules image test cases — NOTICE and provenance
================================================================

This directory contains a frozen, redistributed copy of expert-authored
accessibility test cases from the ACT-Rules Community Group — the cases for the
three rules whose judgment is about an IMAGE — together with the image files
those cases reference.

It is a second vendored set beside `act-gold/`, not an extension of it: that set
holds the five descriptiveness rules and its manifest, checksums and scope
constants are asserted at those counts. The case METADATA is not re-fetched here;
both sets read the same frozen `act-gold/testcases.json` export, so they carry the
same freeze id and no second export can drift from the first.

